          "properties": {
            "altText": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Column chart of median production budget by audience-rating band. Budget does not rise with rating. The 6.0 to 6.5 band has the highest median budget at about 19.6 million dollars, while the best-rated band of 7.5 and above has a median budget of about 12 million. Higher ratings are not bought with bigger budgets.'"
